==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 250,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Hyppoh]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

